                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "ChOHX",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "$color.text.primary",
                      "content": "Sidebar Primitive Mapping (shadcn/ui sidebar)",
                      "fontFamily": "$font.sans",
                      "fontSize": "$font.size.label",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "rE5bG",
                      "name": "Content",
                      "fill": "$color.text.secondary",
                      "content": "• SidebarProvider: Context provider tracking 'expanded' | 'collapsed' state and mobile open status\n• Sidebar: Root container supporting collapsible='icon' (250px expanded → 64px icon rail)\n• SidebarHeader: Top bar with brand logo and SidebarTrigger (panel-left icon)\n• SidebarContent / SidebarGroup: Scrollable body holding grouped navigation items\n• SidebarMenu / SidebarMenuItem: Flex menu rows with active selection highlight\n• SidebarFooter: Bottom container holding UserBadge and account dropdown menu",
                      "fontFamily": "$font.sans",
                      "fontSize": "$font.size.caption"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "zXSxF",
                  "name": "Card - User Badge Architecture",
                  "width": 580,
                  "fill": "$color.surface",
                  "cornerRadius": "$radius.md",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 8,
                  "padding": 16,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "nicKp",
                      "name": "Title",
                      "fill": "$color.text.primary",
                      "content": "User Badge & Dropdown Mapping (@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu)",
                      "fontFamily": "$font.sans",
                      "fontSize": "$font.size.label",
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "b6dnJ",
                      "name": "Content",
                      "fill": "$color.text.secondary",
                      "content": "• Avatar: 28px circular letter avatar (or user avatar image) with rounded-full radius\n• UserInfo: User name (semibold) and plan tag ('Starter plan' | 'Pro member')\n• Upgrade CTA: Pill-shaped action button triggering upgrade / checkout modal\n• DropdownMenuTrigger: Trigger for account settings, workspace switching, and logout\n• Tooltip.Root: Instant tooltip showing item title when sidebar is in collapsed rail mode",
                      "fontFamily": "$font.sans",
                      "fontSize": "$font.size.caption"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
